simEventDeck: 8 packs (nfl, nba, mlb, nhl, college, gym, afl)
1) Replay: 7 GM packs, seeds 1, 2, 3, drives FLEET, SILENT, STUBBORN, FALLEN, 10 seasons a desk
2) Same seed, same deck; a JSON round trip and repairGmInbox between every two weeks change nothing
3) Weights: equal weights deal the recording, and a weight is a share of the draw, never a rank
4) Story: never two of one story inside its cooldown or in one week, a one shot story once
5) Subject rest: no subject inside its rest or twice in a week, the rest book born pruned
6) Texts: wordings move no deal and no draw, every wording comes up at its share, a key reads the same words
7) Expiry: an open card is settled at exactly w plus expires on its neutral option, nothing moves, the deck never freezes
8) Neutral: every card of every pack off the baseline has an option that moves nothing, and every pack check holds
9) Season clock: a card is held out exactly as careerEventDeck holds it; the week clock is back after exactly N
10) Share and reach: every card of every pack reached over 1,000 seasons, no card above its pack's measured ceiling
11) Registry: every option prints exactly the keys it moves, by exactly the amounts, and bind refuses each breakage
12) Legal: every pack narrated in roles, slots only in words, and a tagged card never lands on a real man
15) Economy: every meter a pack moves, BEST and WORST answered, its seasonal push under the pack's own ceiling
